  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Liubov Popova's Auction Record Jumps 175% With $10.1m Sale",
      "url": "https://heni.com/news/article/liubov-popova-painterly-architectonic-2026-10-14",
      "publisher": "HENI News",
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-14T20:00:00Z",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-10-19T23:20:00+09:00",
      "kind": "article",
      "evidenceSummary": "〈Painterly Architectonic〉(1918, 보드에 연필·유채)이 2026-10-14 크리스티 런던에서 $10.1m(£7.64m)에 팔려 낮은 추정가의 4배 이상, 이전 기록(2007-11-26 소더비 'Still Life with Tray' $3.52m)을 $6.59m 넘긴 작가 최고가라는 것을 확인했습니다. 과거 4회 거래 이력.",
      "usageNote": null
    },
    {
      "title": "Collection of Monsoon founder Peter Simon becomes highest value single-owner collection ever sold at Christie's London",
      "url": "https://www.theartnewspaper.com/2026/10/15/christies-achieves-%C2%A3219m-in-steady-solid-london-sales",
      "publisher": "The Art Newspaper",
